WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:03.619
Toad hurried back to Rat’s house.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.364
Rat was waiting for him.

3
00:00:06.365 --> 00:00:09.791
"They shot at me!" cried Toad.

4
00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:12.023
"I told you," said Rat.

5
00:00:12.024 --> 00:00:14.233
"It’s no use."

6
00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:17.560
"What can we do?" asked Toad.

7
00:00:17.561 --> 00:00:20.848
"The ferrets guard the house," said Rat.

8
00:00:20.849 --> 00:00:23.722
"They watch day and night.

9
00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:27.927
We must wait until we have a plan."

10
00:00:27.928 --> 00:00:34.615
But Toad did not wait.

11
00:00:34.616 --> 00:00:38.744
"I’ll go in through the back," said Toad.

12
00:00:38.745 --> 00:00:42.922
He rowed Rat’s boat to Toad Hall.

13
00:00:42.923 --> 00:00:47.016
Toad watched his house from the boat.

14
00:00:47.017 --> 00:00:50.232
"Everything looks quiet," Toad said.

15
00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:53.262
"I’ll hide under the little bridge."

16
00:00:53.263 --> 00:00:57.465
Toad paddled carefully to the bridge.

17
00:00:57.466 --> 00:01:01.933
"They can’t see me here," he said. Crash

18
00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:04.192
!

19
00:01:04.193 --> 00:01:08.089
A huge stone dropped from above.

20
00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:11.295
It smashed the bottom of the boat.

21
00:01:11.296 --> 00:01:14.859
Water poured in.

22
00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:18.177
"Oh no!" cried Toad.

23
00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:21.126
"The boat is sinking!"

24
00:01:21.127 --> 00:01:25.649
Toad sank with the boat into the river.

25
00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:32.273
Two weasels laughed from the bridge.

26
00:01:32.274 --> 00:01:35.378
"Don’t come back!" they yelled.

27
00:01:35.379 --> 00:01:38.378
"We’ll drop the next one on your head!"

28
00:01:38.379 --> 00:01:41.853
Toad climbed onto the shore.

29
00:01:41.854 --> 00:01:47.262
He walked sadly back to Rat’s house.

30
00:01:47.263 --> 00:01:51.328
"I warned you!" said Rat angrily.

31
00:01:51.329 --> 00:01:54.531
"Now my boat is gone!

32
00:01:54.532 --> 00:01:58.541
The clothes I gave you are ruined!"

33
00:01:58.542 --> 00:02:03.352
Toad sat and put his head in his hands.

